  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759098,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10 Years ROLE: A Chronicle of Repression (Commodore 64)\n\nTen years have passed since Winston Smith’s rebellion in Oceania. The Party’s grip on society has tightened, and the illusion of freedom is more pervasive than ever. *10 Years ROLE* for Commodore 64 plunges you into this chilling dystopia as a newly initiated Outer Party member, tasked with maintaining the status quo. \n\nGameplay blends stealth, puzzle-solving, and limited action sequences. You must navigate the oppressive surveillance of Big Brother, completing assignments while subtly questioning the Party's doctrines.  Failure to conform results in swift and brutal punishment.  \n\nThe game features a branching narrative influenced by your choices, leading to multiple endings that reflect the fragility of hope and the power of individual resistance.  Explore familiar locations from Orwell’s *1984*, now subtly altered and reflecting the Party’s relentless control.  Discover hidden messages and uncover the truth behind the manufactured reality.  Can you maintain your loyalty, or will the seeds of rebellion take root?"
    },
